Yep.  Spoilers...

Use you "\" command to list your discoveries.  You can write scrolls on
that list that you have already discovered.  Note that they must have been
identified, ie, "A tattered scroll called Scare Monster" won't work.

Also, you must have enough ink in your pen.  More powerful scrolls take up
more ink.

I'm not sure about how intelligence factors in.  If you're dumber that a
stump you may not be able to write some scrolls.  I've never had a problem
though.

